# Plugins EXCLUDED from the dsh-plugins monorepo and its publish flow.
#
# Entries are workspace-relative dir prefixes (one per line, `#` comments ok).
# An excluded plugin is a private/never-publish plugin — it lives in the
# dsh-plugins-private repo, NOT here. The publish order refuses to continue if
# any listed path is still a workspace member (fail-closed guard in
# scripts/lib/ordered-packages.mjs), so removing an entry here is the
# deliberate act of re-including a plugin.
#
# Moving a plugin out: move the dir to dsh-plugins-private (keep the per-plugin
# .git history in ~/.dsh/archives/dsh-plugins-git/), `git rm -r` it here, add
# the dir name to this list, commit, and (on a remote-less repo) purge it from
# history with `git filter-branch --index-filter 'git rm -r --cached
# --ignore-unmatch <dir>' -- --all` followed by reflog expire + gc.

dsh-client-ui-countdown
dsh-client-ui-wiki
dsh-api-wiki-controller
